21426	projects	{"agency code":"OBM01","project name":"COVID Safety - Veterans Posts","project identification number":"042508","description":"Grants to Congressionally chartered veterans service organizations in Ohio with an active post location. The funding will be used to assist Ohio veterans posts in operating safely during the COVID-19 public health emergency, including supporting increased sanitation costs, maintaining social distancing, purchasing personal\\r\\nprotective equipment (PPE) and other necessary costs to comply with public health orders, local health department\\r\\nrecommendations, and best practices.","naming convention":"OBM01-042508-093020-v1.xlsx"}	2020-12-02 08:47:25.586693-06	58	\N	\N	59
