23543	projects	{"agency code":"DEV01","project name":"Coronavirus Relief Minority/Women-Owned Grant Program","project identification number":"195608","description":"The Minority-Owned Businesses COVID-19 Relief Grant program will provide grants of $10,000 per business affected by the current economic crisis caused by the COVID-19 pandemic. This grant will provide access to much needed capital for up to 500 minority- and women-owned companies in order to continue operating now, and to prepare for the future","naming convention":"DEV01-195608-093020-v1.xlsx"}	2020-12-02 14:33:04.555309-06	68	\N	\N	48
