23547	projects	{"agency code":"DNR01","project name":"Coronavirus Relief DNR COVID Safety","project identification number":"725697","description":"Fund seasonal positions through December 30 in order to meet COVID-19 sanitary and social distancing requirements in ODNR public spaces. To open and maintain sanitary and social distancing standards for ODNR restrooms, camp stores, and trails in accordance with new guidelines due to the COVID-19 pandemic, these additional seasonal staff are needed.","naming convention":"DNR01-725697-093020-v1.xlsx"}	2020-12-02 14:33:04.555309-06	68	\N	\N	48
